#: ../../source/docs/common-rangefinder-lidarlite.rst:122
#: 8965c090c75c41ffa324bb1eadcacc3b
msgid "Testing the sensor"
msgstr "测试传感器"

#: ../../source/docs/common-rangefinder-lidarlite.rst:124
#: cb09b4fdc2194ebd97578d314ac14397
msgid ""
"Distances read by the sensor can be seen in the Mission Planner's Flight "
"Data screen's Status tab.  Look closely for \"rangefinder1\". It's best to "
"place the Lidar several known distances (1m, 3m, 5m) from a large flat wall "
"to test it.  If the Lidar is constantly reading wrong by a fixed offset e.g."
" it's always 50cm out at each distance then adjust the ``RNGFNDx_OFFSET`` "
"parameter by the correct amount.  If however it gets the distance wrong each"
" time by a different amount then the ``RNGFNDx_SCALING`` parameter needs "
"changing.  Update it (maybe 1.1 or 0.9) and test again and repeat until it's"
" correct."
msgstr ""
"传感器读取的距离值可在 Mission Planner "
"飞行数据页面的「状态」选项卡中查看，请留意「rangefinder1」项。建议将激光雷达放置在距大型平整墙面若干已知距离处（1m、3m、5m）进行测试。若激光雷达始终以固定偏差读取错误距离（如每次都偏差"
" 50cm），请通过 ``RNGFNDx_OFFSET`` 参数进行修正。若每次读数偏差不同，则需调整 ``RNGFNDx_SCALING`` "
"参数（可尝试 1.1 或 0.9），测试后反复调整直至准确。"

